chived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-06-11T23:12:54Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T20:20:22Z","closed_at":"2026-06-18T20:20:22Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot v4.6.3.stable\n- Reproducible in Godot v4.5.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.3.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7260) - AMD Ryzen 9 7900 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 31.14 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThis seems to be an issue related to but unsolved by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101384 tested on Windows.\n\nIf both left and right shift are released at the exact same time, one of the keys never gets a release event and fails to release. As far as the engine is concerned, it is reported as still being held down. This happens regardless of if it's checked using an input action or raw keycode handling and happens both using the Input singleton and the _input() function. The timing is very tight but pressing both keys over and over will inevitably result in one of them being \"stuck\" until it is pressed and released again.\n\nIt is not directly related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120216 as this issue concerns local builds (tested on Windows) and that issue concerns Web but it uses the same MRP as they both involve how the engine handles using both shift keys at the same time.\n\n**This is specific to the shift keys and does not seem to happen with CTRL**\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nHold down both shift keys and release them at the exact same time. It might take a couple of attempts as the timing is very strict (possibly 1 frame) but if done correctly, one key never gets a release event.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[shift-key-issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28858326/shift-key-issue.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120217/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120217/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}